            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The built-in contexts of nodes that are converted by the converter"
          }
        ],
        "width": 100
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The converter is not called to handle nodes with the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":list_item"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " or "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":table_cell"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " contexts. Instead, it’s up to the converter to access these nodes from the parent node and convert them directly."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "When a method to convert a block is called, the inline markup has not yet been parsed. That parsing and subsequent conversion happens when the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "#content"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " method is called on the node. This is also what triggers the processor to visit the child nodes of that block."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Some methods for converting blocks have to handle the specialized behavior as indicated by the style. For example, the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "convert_listing"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " method also handles source blocks (listing blocks with the source style). And "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "convert_dlist"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " handles qanda lists (dlist blocks with the qanda style)."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":embedded"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " is not a true context, but rather a transform of the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":document"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " context. It’s convert method is called instead of the one for "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":document"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " when the document is loaded in embedded mode (i.e., the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ":standalone"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " option on the processor is "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "false"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ")."
          }
